       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. PERFORMTIMES.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 COUNTER PIC 99 VALUE 0.
       01 REPS    PIC 9  VALUE 4.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           PERFORM 3 TIMES
               DISPLAY "HELLO"
           END-PERFORM
           PERFORM BUMP REPS TIMES
           DISPLAY "COUNTER: " COUNTER
           STOP RUN.

       BUMP.
           ADD 5 TO COUNTER.
